    {
      "title": "feat(nature-figure): allow any OpenAI-compatible images endpoint via …",
      "description": "feat(nature-figure): allow any OpenAI-compatible images endpoint via --api-url\n\nThe schematic script already takes --api-key-env, but the endpoint itself was\na hardcoded constant, so a user whose credit sits with another OpenAI-compatible\nimages gateway could not use this route at all.\n\n--api-url (or SCHEMATIC_IMAGE_API_URL) now selects the endpoint, defaulting to\nthe existing OpenRouter URL so current behaviour is unchanged. The endpoint that\nwas actually called is recorded in request_metadata.json, and request failures\nname it. Documents the flag with an OrcaRouter example.",
